{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2023-01-12 11:30:00', 'title': 'THE SAVARICK GROUP OF WELLS FARGO ADVISORS OFFERS RESOURCES DEDICATED TO MEDICAL PROFESSIONALS', 'text': "RENEWED EMPHASIS OF THE GROUP'S MISSION AIMING TO PROVIDE FINANCIAL SECURITY AND LITERACY FOR HIGHLY SKILLED PROFESSIONALS NEW YORK , JAN. 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE SAVARICK GROUP OF WELLS FARGO ADVISORS UNVEILED ITS PRACTICE CONCENTRATION THAT FOCUSES SPECIFICALLY ON THE FINANCIAL NEEDS OF MEDICAL PROFESSIONALS. EVAN SAVARICK, MANAGING DIRECTOR – INVESTMENTS AND SENIOR PORTFOLIO MANAGER, PROVIDES INDUSTRY SPECIFIC FINANCIAL INSIGHTS TO MEDICAL PROFESSIONALS."}